1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,290
Nine hikers cut their own tent open.

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,340
From the inside.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,140
Then they walked into the snow.

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:05,790
In socks.

5
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:06,560
Some barefoot.

6
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,350
February 1959.

7
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,850
Kholat Syakhl, in the northern Urals.

8
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:13,850
Their tracks led downhill, about a kilometre and a half, to the

9
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:14,360
trees.

10
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,130
Searchers needed until May to find all nine.

11
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,420
Six died of cold.

12
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,880
Three had severe skull or chest fractures.

13
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,080
Theories piled up.

14
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:22,520
Aliens.

15
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,350
A weapons test.

16
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:23,980
An attack.

17
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:27,190
But investigators found no sign of anyone else at the camp.

18
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:31,030
In 2020, Russian prosecutors blamed an avalanche.

19
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,190
Critics objected.

20
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:35,060
The slope was too gentle, with few avalanche signs.

21
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:40,010
Then, in 2021, two scientists tested it, with snow code from Disney's

22
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:40,650
Frozen.

23
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,020
They rebuilt the slope in a computer.

24
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,820
To pitch the tent, the hikers dug into the slope.

25
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,530
Wind piled snow above it.

26
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,380
Their model:

27
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,440
nine to fourteen hours later, a small slab breaks loose.

28
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:53,770
Small enough to leave few traces.

29
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:56,480
Heavy enough to cause injuries like those found.

30
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:58,920
If they're right, that could explain the knife.

31
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:00,140
But not everything.

32
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,240
Even the scientists say it isn't solved.

33
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,330
What would make you cut your way out of a tent?

34
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:06,780
Whatever it was, it started like this.
